            {
             "type": "paragraph",
             "attrs": {
              "align": null
             },
             "content": [
              {
               "text": "If a student is stuck on a prompt, ask them to whisper-read the prompt aloud. Hearing the language, especially complex syntax, often helps students decode the requirement.",
